@startuml
title SD04 - Customer absent at delivery (AD12 / AD15 / AD27)
autonumber

actor "Courier employee" as CourierEmployee
participant "route:Route" as Route
participant "courier:Courier" as Courier
actor "Customer contact" as Contact
participant "first:DeliveryAttempt" as First
participant "second:DeliveryAttempt" as Second
participant "order:Order" as Order
actor "Sales employee" as Sales

CourierEmployee -> Route: showSchedule(date)
activate Route
note right of Route: Input: delivery date.
Route --> CourierEmployee: times, customers, addresses, contact persons and phone numbers
deactivate Route
note right of CourierEmployee
  At the first visit, nobody answers the door.
  Call the customer before rescheduling (AD27).
end note
CourierEmployee -> Courier: lookUpCustomerPhoneNumber(customer)
activate Courier
Courier --> CourierEmployee: phone number
deactivate Courier
CourierEmployee -> Contact: Call customer after first unanswered visit
Contact --> CourierEmployee: can or cannot receive now

alt Customer can still receive during first visit
  CourierEmployee -> Contact: Request signature for the received medicines
  Contact --> CourierEmployee: signed proof of receipt
  CourierEmployee -> First: recordReceiptSignature()
  First --> CourierEmployee: signed receipt registered
  CourierEmployee -> First: markDelivered(timestamp)
  First --> CourierEmployee: delivery and time recorded
  CourierEmployee -> Order: changeOrderStatus(delivered)
  Order --> CourierEmployee: order status delivered
else Customer cannot receive during first visit
  CourierEmployee -> First: markRecipientAbsent()
  First --> CourierEmployee: first attempt marked absent
  note right of CourierEmployee: Leave a notice at the delivery address that a visit was attempted.
  CourierEmployee -> Route: adjustSchedule()
  Route --> CourierEmployee: second attempt scheduled for the SAME day
  note right of CourierEmployee: The second result is not yet known when scheduled.
  alt Recipient present at second attempt
    CourierEmployee -> Contact: Request signature for the received medicines
    Contact --> CourierEmployee: signed proof of receipt
    CourierEmployee -> Second: recordReceiptSignature()
    Second --> CourierEmployee: signature recorded
    CourierEmployee -> Second: markDelivered(timestamp)
    Second --> CourierEmployee: second attempt delivered and time recorded
    CourierEmployee -> Order: changeOrderStatus(delivered)
    Order --> CourierEmployee: order status delivered
  else Recipient absent at second attempt
    CourierEmployee -> Second: markRecipientAbsent()
    Second --> CourierEmployee: second attempt marked absent
    CourierEmployee -> Order: changeOrderStatus(notDelivered)
    Order --> CourierEmployee: order status not delivered
    note right of CourierEmployee: Return goods to the distribution area.
    CourierEmployee -> Sales: Report undelivered order
    Sales -> Contact: Agree new delivery date and morning/afternoon slot
    Contact --> Sales: agreed date and time slot
    Sales -> Order: setDeliveryTime(date, timeSlot)
    Order --> Sales: appointment updated
    Sales -> Order: recordAdditionalDeliveryCosts(amount, explanation)
    Order --> Sales: extra costs and reason recorded
  end
end
@enduml
